  "details": "If you use standard Unity UI shader like in my prefab https://vrcmods.com/item/5407-Video-Player-TV-Stand everything will apper pink in VRChat while in Unity everything looks fine. \n\nThere is also a issue with other shaders like the one made for the realtime clock prefab (https://github.com/makitsune/realtime-clock) \n\nThis ONLY effects new worlds, old worlds are fine so I assume this is a SDK issue. This is kinda similar to the Terrain shader being broken for god only knows how long, but this is worse as its blindingly pink",
